<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="reference_if2_kdq_cqb">
    <title>AT+MHTTPCONTENT 设置HTTP CONTENT数据</title>
    <shortdesc>该命令用于设置HTTP content数据。</shortdesc>
    <refbody>
        <table id="table_fls_d1c_jqb">
            <tgroup cols="2">
                <colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" colwidth="3*" align="left"/>
                <colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" colwidth="7*" align="left"/>
                <thead>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><cmdname>AT+MHTTPCONTENT</cmdname></entry>
                    </row>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry>语法</entry>
                        <entry>响应</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>测试命令<codeblock><cmdname>AT+MHTTPCONTENT=?</cmdname></codeblock></entry>
                        <entry>成功<msgblock id="msgblock_qxh_fd5_pqb">+MHTTPCONTENT: (list of supported &lt;httpid>s),(list of supported &lt;eof>s),(list of supported &lt;length>s),
OK</msgblock>
                            错误<msgblock id="msgblock_dyl_fd5_pqb">+CME ERROR: &lt;err></msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>设置命令<codeblock><cmdname>AT+MHTTPCONTENT=&lt;httpid>[,&lt;eof>[,&lt;length>[,&lt;data>]]]</cmdname></codeblock></entry>
                        <entry>成功 <div>只设置<varname>&lt;httpid></varname>，读取当前已设置的数据：</div>
                            <msgblock id="msgblock_v5c_zqv_3sb">[+MHTTPCONTENT: &lt;httpid>,&lt;length>,&lt;data>]
OK</msgblock><varname>&lt;eof></varname>设置，<varname>&lt;length></varname>和<varname>&lt;data></varname>不设置，以<msgph>CTRL+Z</msgph>发送数据，以<keyword>ESC</keyword>取消发送： <msgblock id="msgblock_q1q_hd5_pqb">>(输入数据)
OK</msgblock>
                            <varname>&lt;length></varname>设置，<varname>&lt;data></varname>不设置，输入数据达到指定长度或达到超时时间时发送数据：<msgblock id="msgblock_hj5_hd5_pqb">>(输入数据)
OK</msgblock> 所有参数均设置：<msgblock id="msgblock_vk1_3d5_pqb">OK</msgblock>
                            错误
                            <msgblock id="msgblock_xwf_3d5_pqb">+CME ERROR: &lt;err></msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">命令描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                >单次请求有效，请求结束后自动清空。设置命令中不带<varname>&lt;data></varname>参数，模组将进入数据模式，以<keyword>></keyword>提示，然后输入数据。普通传输模式时，先设置content数据，然后使用<cmdname>AT+MHTTPREQUEST</cmdname>发送请求；Chunked模式时，需先使用<cmdname>AT+MHTTPREQUEST</cmdname>发送请求，然后使用该命令发送content。<fn>Chunked模式下，发送请求并接收到<cmdname>+MHTTPURC:
                                    "ind"</cmdname>上报后，使用该命令发送 content 。</fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">参数描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                    ><varname>&lt;httpid></varname>客户端实例id，0~3。<fn>MN319/MN319-A/MN316A/MN326A：<varname>&lt;httpid></varname>参数范围0~1。</fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><varname>&lt;eof></varname>数据输入指示。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">
                            <parml id="parml_ylv_2jz_frb">
                                <plentry>
                                    <pt>0</pt>
                                    <pd>content输入结束标记，需请求完成或清空后才可再次输入。</pd>
                                </plentry>
                                <plentry>
                                    <pt>1</pt>
                                    <pd>后续还有content数据输入。</pd>
                                </plentry>
                                <plentry>
                                    <pt>2</pt>
                                    <pd>清空已有content内容，只对非Chunked模式有效。</pd>
                                </plentry>
                            </parml>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><varname>&lt;length></varname>输入数据长度，0~4096，数据模式下不可设置为0，命令中直接输入数据时，设置为0，不对数据长度进行校验，设置大于0，将对输入数据的长度进行校验（ASCII字符串和带转义的字符串输入模式下：校验实际命令中输入字符串长度是否与指定长度相等；HEX字符串输入模式下：校验实际命令中输入字符串长度是否是指定长度的两倍）。<fn>
                                <div><ph product="tbd"
                                    >MN327：命令直接输入模式下，单条命令最大长度为2048，超过将报错。</ph></div>
                                <div>ML302S/ML307S/ML302A/ML305A/ML307A/ML307G/ML305M/ML307R/ML307B/ML307C/ML307M/ML307H/ML307N/MR380R<ph
                                        product="tbd"
                                        ><?oxy_insert_start author="surui" timestamp="20260616T195101+0800"?>/MR380M<?oxy_insert_end?></ph>：数据模式下可设置为0。</div>
                                <div>ML305U：数据模式下可设置为0，参数缺省时为0。</div>
                                <div>ML307G：支持的content总长度为3*4096字节。</div>
                            </fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><varname>&lt;data></varname>content数据，单次请求有效，请求结束后自动清空。<fn>
                                <div><cmdname>AT+MHTTPCFG="encoding"</cmdname>中设置的<varname>&lt;input_format></varname>参数，只对直接命令中带<varname>&lt;data></varname>的输入模式有效，对数据模式输入无效，数据模式直接使用原始数据。</div>
                                <div>ML302S/ML307S/ML302A/ML305A/ML307A/ML307G/ML305U/ML305M/ML307R/ML307B/ML307C/ML307M/ML307H/ML307N/ML307X/ML307Y：字符串参数内部不能包含引号，如果字符串参数内部一定要包含引号，需使用数据模式进行发送。
                                        <div product="tbd"
                                        ><?oxy_insert_start author="surui@cmiot.cmcc" timestamp="20260422T102234+0800"?>MR380M：<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_insert_start author="zhangqin1@cmiot.cmcc" timestamp="20260423T140916+0800"?>CONTENT内容不支持连续输入双引号和逗号。<?oxy_insert_end?>
                                    </div></div>
                            </fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">示例</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                            >设置content数据（命令中带数据输入）<msgblock id="codeblock_pvx_rvj_1rb"><cmdname>AT+MHTTPCONTENT=0,0,0,"{"id":"speed1"\r,"tags":["mobile"],"unit":"m/s"\r,"unit_symbol":"m/s"}"</cmdname>
OK</msgblock>
                            设置content数据（命令中不带数据输入）<msgblock id="codeblock_gsz_svj_1rb"><cmdname>AT+MHTTPCONTENT=0,0,70</cmdname>
>{"id":"speed1"\r,"tags":["mobile"],"unit":"m/s"\r,"unit_symbol":"m/s"}
OK</msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
        <section id="section_erq_hxt_rrb">
            <note id="note_q5b_3xt_rrb">
                <div><ph product="tbd"
                        >M5310-E/MN327/MN328/</ph>MN318/MN316/MN319/MN319-A/MN326/MN316A/MN326A：不支持<keyword>></keyword>下的数据输入模式，只能在AT命令中直接输入数据，单次输入长度受平台单条命令长度限制，数据过长时建议分多次输入。</div>
                <div>MN319/MN319-A：AT命令参数的最大长度为1560字节。</div>
                <div>ML307X/ML307Y：总共可以写入的数据长度不超过8192字节。</div>
                <div>ML307B：AT命令参数的最大长度为3000字节。</div>
            </note>
        </section>
    </refbody>
</reference>
